<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trico Marine rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trico Marine rated a buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies and Co Inc on Friday said it has begun coverage with a buy rating of Trico Marine Services Inc, an operator of supply ships and other vessels in the Gulf of Mexico and offshore Brazil.</p>
<p>-- said the supply vessel market should be capacity constrained &quot;for several years&quot;.</p>
<p>-- said the industry is ripe for consolidation through acquisition.</p>
<p>-- said the stock has the potential to trade in the $56 to $60 per share range, which it reached earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Trico shares were up 3-5/8 at 43-1/2 by mid-morning.</p>
</text>
